{"2846870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Chili Man", "steam_appid": 2846870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/d2a211d87357be48253a7432b304f9e0.webp?t=1761829986\" width=250 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gameplay similar to <i>Only Up!, Super Chili Man</i> is a two-player cooperative platformer. Two players take turns controlling the same flexible and resilient magical chili pepper, leaping ever upwards within a giant pot constructed from vegetables, fruits, and all kinds of food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player's actions consume their own stamina but restore their partner's. Thus, both players must collaborate closely and take turns operating the chili.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/cedc7a4757a8eab3e4c9194f85c48e9c.poster.avif?t=1761829986\" width=640 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/cedc7a4757a8eab3e4c9194f85c48e9c.webm?t=1761829986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/cedc7a4757a8eab3e4c9194f85c48e9c.mp4?t=1761829986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/6161fc16c3d384fde1cf94eb38dcee6d.webp?t=1761829986\" width=250 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic obstacles and new mechanics! Including shifting level structures as the soup water level changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/0123188f79f0a696512a028dce07d35e.poster.avif?t=1761829986\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/0123188f79f0a696512a028dce07d35e.webm?t=1761829986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/0123188f79f0a696512a028dce07d35e.mp4?t=1761829986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/22a9c5950ec45ebde60c55e6f320fe88.webp?t=1761829986\" width=250 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based explosives, cannons, and bounce pads. Carefully control your chili—or get blasted away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/1db0383fe5b468ccc58718e03aab2fe3.poster.avif?t=1761829986\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/1db0383fe5b468ccc58718e03aab2fe3.webm?t=1761829986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/1db0383fe5b468ccc58718e03aab2fe3.mp4?t=1761829986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X：ChillX (@xu4086015626872) / X</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846870/extras/d2a211d87357be48253a7432b304f9e0.webp?t=1761829986\" width=250 height=28 />